; Rescued, not a starter: the Fallow Fields' chapter wizard, freed by paying the Tithe-Reeve's scale its due
; (.ai/chapter-wizards.md 4.2). The sorceress of Colchis, granddaughter of the Sun, held in the reeve's granary and
; counted with the grain. Her passive is the Salve since 2026-11-09 - the charm she gave Jason against the bulls'
; fire: enemy bolts deal her 30% less (Player.TakeBoltDamage), which helps the stand her Solar Flare asks for. It was
; Rejuvenation, +20% healing, worth little once healing was made scarce (.ai/character-fit.md). She opens on Solar Flare, two elements (Light and Fire) - a freed wizard may (R2); the
; form deepens Fire.
